    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Must Come Down is a 2012 independent feature film written and directed by Kenny Riches, starring David Fetzer and Ashly Burch (who is known for her role in the video game parody series, \"Hey Ash, Whatcha Playin'? \"). It was produced by Patrick Fugit and Dominic Fratto. \"Must Come Down\" is Riches' first feature film, and after premiering at the Cinequest Film Festival in March 2012, the film went on to play the Phoenix Film Festival, Newport Beach Film Festival, and Minneapolis–Saint Paul International Film Festival.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
